 * |---------------------------------|---------|-----------------------------------|
 * | AM, PM                          | a..aaa  | AM, PM                            |
 * |                                 | aaaa    | a.m., p.m.                        |
 * |                                 | aaaaa   | a, p                              |
 * | Calendar year                   | y       | 44, 1, 1900, 2017                 |
 * |                                 | yy      | 44, 01, 00, 17                    |
 * |                                 | yyy     | 044, 001, 000, 017                |
 * |                                 | yyyy    | 0044, 0001, 1900, 2017            |
 * | Month (formatting)              | M       | 1, 2, ..., 12                     |
 * |                                 | MM      | 01, 02, ..., 12                   |
 * | Day of month                    | d       | 1, 2, ..., 31                     |
 * |                                 | dd      | 01, 02, ..., 31                   |
 * | Hour [1-12]                     | h       | 1, 2, ..., 11, 12                 |
 * |                                 | hh      | 01, 02, ..., 11, 12               |
 * | Hour [0-23]                     | H       | 0, 1, 2, ..., 23                  |
 * |                                 | HH      | 00, 01, 02, ..., 23               |
 * | Minute                          | m       | 0, 1, ..., 59                     |
 * |                                 | mm      | 00, 01, ..., 59                   |
 * | Second                          | s       | 0, 1, ..., 59                     |
 * |                                 | ss      | 00, 01, ..., 59                   |
 * | Fraction of second              | S       | 0, 1, ..., 9                      |
 * |                                 | SS      | 00, 01, ..., 99                   |
 * |                                 | SSS     | 000, 001, ..., 999                |
 * |                                 | SSSS    | ...                               |
